#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:18
#: 1270296660ae469b8bb24aed977130c4 12d020721ff44777882f5f881ab2ec22
#: 4358fa19bb8c4db2bc1c44c53c312275 4c0856e8347343f89bb9955407e4bb2e
